6JNXuw2MqK8ut2-0DWhLk62Kn1ehnbtI_lq4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRpUaxlKe61XoQQLNYzZixw6OnmYy9EQ9MmccC7DXH1CQ&oe=6B0B385A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BioSuite Virtual: Lab-Scale Fermentation", "keywords": ["Science", "Biomanufacturing", "Fermentation", "Biotech", "Training"], "long_description": "# Train Smarter, Not Harder\nWhether you're preparing college students for a biomanufacturing job or onboarding employees in a lab, BioSuite Virtual removes common barriers\u2014limited equipment, instructor bandwidth, safety risks\u2014and replaces them with scalable, immersive learning.\n- No Lab Equipment, No Waste, No Risk\n- Scalable & Self-Paced\n- Always Available, Always Repeatable\n- Informed by Industry\n- Performance Tracking  \n# BioSuite Virtual Key Features\nBuilt for realism and interaction, BioSuite Virtual offers an unmatched simulation of real-world lab experiences\u2014without the capital investment and overhead. Users gain competence and confidence before using real equipment.\n- Realistic Lab Environments \n- Hands-On Assembly Tasks \n- Interactive Control Unit \n- Repeatable Practice Modules \n- Virtual Safety Protocols\u200b\u200b\n- Learning Management System Integration\n# Learning Design That Drives Results\nGrounded in proven learning science, BioSuite Virtual ensures that trainees not only understand how to perform tasks, but why they matter.\n- Step-by-Step Guidance\n- In-Depth Animations\n- Contextual Prompts\n- Knowledge Checks\n- Virtual Demonstrations", "short_description": "BioSuite Virtual is high-fidelity, self-paced training for tomorrow\u2019s biomanufacturing workforce that blends cutting-edge Mixed Reality immersion, intuitive interface design, and proven learning design. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://biosuitevirtual.com/privacy/biosuite-virtual", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Prism Immersive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://biosuitevirtual.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1156320664239317"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1877004159937795"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2147610239430628"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1877004159937795"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1786584420, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1877004159937795"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1363987400139308", "version": "216"}, "id": "1164547462532127", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1115813141623403", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1363987400139308"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1164547462532127"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1794204898, "id": "1363987400139308", "version": "216", "version_code": 216, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_